  "description": "zplCore.com Testing+: semantic label assertions for .NET tests (xUnit, NUnit, MSTest – no framework dependency). Assert what a ZPL label prints, not only how it looks: barcodes decode with the expected data and grade, quiet zones, text inside the label, no overlaps or clipping, compliance packs (GS1, Amazon, UPS …), field values, printer fit, and pixel snapshots with an approval workflow and semantic diff. Includes the label check runner behind 'zplcore check' (JUnit XML, SARIF, text) for CI and pull requests.",
